  ('d60d1dd7-23a6-4aeb-8308-9f111be7eecf', '2026-03-28 04:32:43.700122+00', '2026-03-28 17:17:09.026516+00', '1fc50da1-2664-4931-8cab-64e24dc5ed8c', '16 North Harvard Street', 'Boston', 'MA', '02163', '42.3679541', '-71.1239595', 'condo', '3', '1.5', '3456', NULL, '2022', '0', 'draft', 'Discover your dream retreat at Harbor Towers, where luxury urban living meets serene coastal charm. Welcome to Unit 36G—a 1,231 sq. ft. home perched high above Boston’s waterfront, offering sweeping city and harbor views.This thoughtfully designed 2-bedroom unit features a spacious entry with ample storage, an open living & dining area framed by oversized windows, & a private balcony off the second bedroom—perfect for soaking in the fresh harbor breeze. The primary bedroom is a tranquil retreat w/ a large closet, while the two fully renovated bathrooms combine elegance w/ functionality. Harbor Towers offers a lifestyle of convenience w/ 24/7 concierge service, a welcoming lobby, & premium amenities like a seasonal heated outdoor pool, BBQ grills, & direct access to Boston''s scenic Harbor Walk. Pet-friendly & ideally located, it places you steps from world-class dining, shopping, cultural attractions, historic landmarks and easy highway access. A true Boston urban oasis.

