  ('be8d4e9a-798d-456b-8b7b-152b7f3d43a6', '2025-12-25 08:27:29.784732+00', '2026-03-28 02:12:16.226626+00', '1fc50da1-2664-4931-8cab-64e24dc5ed8c', '28-32 ATLANTIC AVE', 'Boston', 'MA', '02110', NULL, NULL, 'condo', '2', '3', '2542', NULL, '1850', '4270000', 'back_on_market', 'Architect-designed brick & beam waterfront residence at Lewis Wharf offers 2,530 sq. ft. of luxury with unobstructed harbor & city views. Custom-built by Payne Bouchier, this south-facing home blends historic detail with modern craftsmanship. The open-concept main level features exposed beams, a wood-burning fireplace, and seamless flow to a private walk-out terrace—perfect for entertaining. Extensive hardwood built-ins include bureaus and a striking Hawaiian Koa staircase. A professionally designed lighting system with whole-house controls sets the mood throughout. The primary suite offers custom cabinetry, a massive walk-in, and spa-like bath. A private guest suite with ensuite bath, additional office with balcony, and sweeping water views complete the home. Other highlights: wide-plank flooring, designer finishes, and, separate laundry room. Lewis Wharf amenities include 24-hour concierge, gardens, heated pool, marina, and elevator access. Prime, convenient location.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/be8d4e9a-798d-456b-8b7b-152b7f3d43a6/0.7267744968741802.jpg'', ''name'': ''''},{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/be8d4e9a-798d-456b-8b7b-152b7f3d43a6/0.717076516492637.jpg'', ''name'': ''''},{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/be8d4e9a-798d-456b-8b7b-152b7f3d43a6/1766652389135_1118328-_MAP9812.jpg'', ''name'': ''''},{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/be8d4e9a-798d-456b-8b7b-152b7f3d43a6/1766652390854_1118332-_MAP9849.jpg'', ''name'': '''