  ('f5aace9a-d002-4101-a42f-9505c1947362', '2025-11-12 04:14:33.869875+00', '2026-03-28 03:48:41.985997+00', '976a874d-2c36-4799-b29e-db43604f01d8', '33 Sleeper St, Boston, MA 02210, USA', 'Boston', 'MA', '02210', '42.3522602', '-71.0487553', 'condo', '2', '1', '1320', '1270', '1911', '1375000', 'active', 'Amazing oversized loft home open one bedroom....with ample closets...can easily become a 2 bedroom 2 bath, High ceilings, exposed bricks and beams.... one deeded parking space in the Courtyard can be purchased for $250,000. Well established condo building in Prime seaport location steps to all the city and the vibrant Seaport community has to offer....easy access to the T, Pike, Expressway, Amtrak , Logan and Fast Ferry to Provincetown all at your doorsteps... Trader Joe''s one block away, and Numerous dining and entertainment venues...Movies, Bowling , darts, pickle ball and so much more..Spacious open loft one bedroom with high ceilings, exposed bricks and beams. Washer/dryer, AC, amazing all new custom kitchen. with breakfast bar. Sunny eastern exposure. New Windows, and Heat pump system. . All new bathroom floor. Unit now has brand new vanity, and brand new hardwood floors. Live in this premiere loft building in the heart of the emerging seaport district.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/f5aace9a-d002-4101-a42f-9505c1947362/1762987640022_photo%20(95).jpeg'', ''name'': ''''},{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/f5aace9a-d002-4101-a42f-9505c1947362/1762987641168_photo%20(96).jpeg'', ''name'': ''''},{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/f5aace9a-d002-4101-a42f-9505c1947362/1762987641700_photo%20(97).jpeg'', ''name'': ''''},{''url'': ''https://qocduqtfbsevnhlgsfka.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/listing-photos/f5aace9a-d002-4101-a42f-9505c1947362/1762987642286_pho